: "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_28369212172730796_5258581881626541407_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RYuxsfr8Sz8Q7kNvwHFCT8l&_nc_oc=AdoAsq1syeqvu4NSMgBMbUaxR2zzkwU1eoqT_MCZ626mY0hD-BWyRB0Ot9cOYmaxN6U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPMW_CeU6TH3DW2xrrgD1rjwNY03ZGbODx0QLaeMyBeqw&oe=6AD0D687"}, {"file_name": "store-04-source-assembly.png", "id": "1548633643226364", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JlB_4MlhsR8Q7kNvwHdNHBV&_nc_oc=AdrBFSaAyHgqRWiSAAn1xO1QfmQcVaQSc79OZxE08bbEjXndWlNu4qZdt9iWDro98lA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMCjA7nDQC5PGtvhtELZMssZxd56FVGHEJobUezWqJ4Yg&oe=6AD0D520"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4xVkIa26T9IQ7kNvwGmEiiG&_nc_oc=AdobUi3dWsisasYDuJ2vO4tBprryUpbtHhINPeLJvOmncrZWv_DYqypxnXEp3kSCYVw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOgPge1NngYSt6oSVNWJZHFHNnae8w1rKc88s9FCWMVCQ&oe=6AD0DEA2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sbVm5M1hXY8Q7kNvwGNUcZP&_nc_oc=Adpj3XNF4nUR2mgWgk5gseavJrJexB9nCIjxLFetUawoS6zmnA00b34upNx_Gfl0pMY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM_UevAei7cgvtXEz0mvRcNC58PXaEPRdECrsYq2tl2mw&oe=6AD10581"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b9ysMvMiM8gQ7kNvwE7DvnG&_nc_oc=AdpRSKgEkHnb9k0FfpHsrkQ_fhEBBTJHlvIqEIXOzkf_nISukTKdwhZRLsh3lQ-yr7g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMV309AGyATCPTFOCUu0HqFk8-mc3698RXzz844oNwT6g&oe=6AD0F392"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer